    "hn_item_id": 41901060,
    "item_type": "comment",
    "story_subtype": null,
    "title": null,
    "url": null,
    "text_html": "<p>Obsidian is solid if you keep notes in a plain folder. For sync, I’ve had the least trouble with Syncthing + git for backups.</p>",
